  "description": "Fixture-side dual-mode container acquisition for Tamp adopters. Tests reach an adjacent Postgres / Azurite / Service Bus emulator via a standardized env var contract on CI, and spawn a local Testcontainers instance on dev workstations — same connection-string shape, automatic disposal of locally-spawned containers only. Solves the Docker-in-Docker \"sibling container trap\" once instead of in every adopter. Companion to Tamp.Testcontainers.V4 (probe) and Tamp.AdjacentContainer.Provisioning (CI-side stack-up).",
